#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:2
msgid "Nutanix Prism Central"
msgstr "Nutanix Prism Central"

#: ../../integration_guides/Clouds/prismCentral/prismCentral.rst:4
msgid ""
"|morpheus| offers Nutanix Prism Central Cloud integration support through"
" and official plugin. Adding the plugin to a |morpheus| appliance adds a "
"new Cloud integration type for Nutanix Prism Central. Download the plugin"
" from the |morpheus| `Plugin Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com"
"/morpheus-nutanix-prism/about>`_ and upload it to the appliance. Plugins "
"are uploaded at |AdmIntPlu|. See |morpheus| `plugin documentation "
"<https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_"
" for more details on adding plugins."
msgstr "|morpheus| propose la prise en charge de l'intégration Cloud Nutanix Prism Central via un plug-in officiel. L'ajout du plug-in à une appliance |morpheus| ajoute un nouveau type d'intégration Cloud pour Nutanix Prism Central. Téléchargez le plug-in depuis le `Plugin Exchange <https://share.morpheusdata.com/morpheus-nutanix-prism/about>`_ |morpheus| et importez-le sur l'appliance. Les plug-ins sont importés dans |AdmIntPlu|. Consultez la `documentation des plug-ins <https://docs.morpheusdata.com/en/latest/administration/integrations/integrations.html#plugins>`_ |morpheus| pour plus de détails sur l'ajout de plug-ins."

